# Reserved for application packages.
#
# In a future commit, the existing Next.js web app currently living at
# `<repo-root>/src/` will be moved to `<repo-root>/apps/web/`. The iOS
# app (Expo) will live at `<repo-root>/apps/mobile/` once development
# starts.
#
# Until then this directory is intentionally empty. The npm workspaces
# declaration in the root package.json includes `apps/*`, so any
# package added here is auto-discovered.
